          "text": "Description: On October 21, 1977, around 5:15 PM, two witnesses observed the passage of a elongated object in the sky. Bright and multi-colored, the object moved, leaving behind a dimming glow. It quickly disappeared, hidden by the landscape. No other testimony was collected on this phenomenon, for which we lack information.",
